sequenceDiagram
    title Retrieve an existing document
    autonumber
    actor Reader
    participant Web as Web client
    participant API
    participant Database
    participant Storage as Object storage

    Reader->>Web: Open document
    Web->>API: Request document (document identifier)
    API->>Database: Query document location
    Database-->>API: Return document location
    API->>Storage: Request document bytes
    Storage-->>API: Return document bytes
    API-->>Web: Return document
    Web-->>Reader: Display document
